  "uniform_stage_and_lift": "For c(o) children the unconstrained uniform-new law induces c(o)/|N| on old words. The unconditioned lift of mu gives mu(o)/c(o) per child and retains refused mass on old words with no child. For complete uniform old support, agreement requires positive constant c on all old words. For any nominated prior, agreement requires mu=c/|N|. All priors survive iff restriction is onto."
